sequenceDiagram
    actor Customer
    participant App
    participant Functions
    participant Auth
    participant Firestore
    participant Storage
    participant SES
    Customer->>App: Account and referral fields
    App->>Functions: newAccount
    Functions->>Auth: Create identity
    Functions->>Firestore: Create user and registration
    Functions->>Storage: Generate QR at stored path
    App->>Auth: Sign in
    App->>Firestore: Observe registration and slots
    Customer->>App: Edit children and select appointment
    App->>Functions: Save child or appointment draft
    App->>Functions: completeRegistration
    Functions->>Firestore: Submit and create email queue document
    Firestore->>Functions: Email document creation event
    Functions->>Firestore: Resolve published template key
    Functions->>SES: Send mapped template
    App->>Storage: Read qrCodeStoragePath
